        <ExplanationTxt>LINE 11B THE COMPLETE FORM 990 WAS PREPARED, PROVIDED TO AND DISCUSSED BY ALL BOARD MEMBERS AT THE MARCH 27, 2025 BOARD MEETING. THE BOARD VOTED AT THAT MEETING TO APPROVE AND FILE THE 2024 FORM 990 AND SCHEDULES A,B,I AND O WITH THE IRS PRIOR TO THE MAY 15, 2025 DEADLINE.</ExplanationTxt>
