        <ExplanationTxt>THE CONFLICT OF INTEREST POLICY, WAS ORIGINALLY APPROVED BY THE BOARD ON MARCH 28,2013, WAS REVIEWED AT THE MARCH 27,2025 BOARD MEETING. THE BOARD AGREED THAT NO CHANGES WERE NEEDED TO THE POLICY AND ALL BOARD MEMBERS SIGNED THEIR ANNUAL STATEMENT LISTING POTENTIAL CONFLICTS AND PROVIDED THEM TO THE EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR.</ExplanationTxt>
